    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Premise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apocalypse unleashed, no place is safe anymore. After her hometown was stormed by a legion of living dead, little Bianka Lovelace must use her guts and wits in order to traverse this hellish landscape with the hope of finding her beloved father and escape. However, a figure of her past, Lucy, will make this adventure imposible.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Bianka overcome her most frightful fears and achieve her happy ending? or have the weight of someone's sins doomed everyone?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Details</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different endings\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\u00a0different weapons\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many scenarios in the city to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse array of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't bother playing if you have a problem with the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mentions of SA, Incest and more &quot;problematic&quot; themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loli protagonist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death and gore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suicide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Humor</p></li></ul>",
